Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.89,0:01:58.85,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}在只差一步時跌倒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.85,0:02:02.52,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,以為到極限而消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.52,0:02:04.52,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,但我依然堅持前行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:08.32,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,不甘心就這樣結束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:11.28,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,只要閉上雙眼想像
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.32,0:02:11.28,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(106,565,\blur2)\t(565,815,\blur0)}只要閉上{\alpha&HFF&}雙眼想像
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:15.37,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,總能看見你在身旁
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.28,0:02:15.37,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(66,400,\blur2)\t(400,858,\blur0)}總能看見{\alpha&HFF&}你在身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.37,0:02:20.33,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,面帶我最愛的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:22.62,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,安靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.62,0:02:26.50,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,故事還在進行之中
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.62,0:02:26.50,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(2980,3355,\blur3)\t(3355,3772,\blur0)}故事還在進行之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.92,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,安靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:32.88,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,讓我們翻開下一頁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:36.14,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,不用擔心我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:39.81,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,只因心中時刻有你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:42.93,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,總能聽見你的助威
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:44.69,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,讓我變得更加堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:48.11,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,就算覺得堅持不住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.11,0:02:51.86,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,忍不住要流下眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:54.95,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,總能聽見你的助威
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.95,0:02:57.91,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,我一直都感覺良好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:03:00.87,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,絕對不會輕言放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:07.04,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\t(5700,6180,\alpha&HC8&)}愛的力量多麼神奇
Comment: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ending
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.33,0:21:50.42,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,0)}就算身處遙遠又未知的星球
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.42,0:21:54.54,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,仰望著頭頂的那片陌生的天空
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.54,0:21:58.51,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,就算深愛過的人和許下的諾言
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.51,0:22:01.76,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,還有其他的一切都不在手邊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:06.76,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(750,1810,\alpha&H00&)\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}我依然記憶猶新
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.76,0:22:06.76,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,我依然記憶猶新
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.89,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}時間之海默默記錄著你的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.89,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,時間之海默默記錄著你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.89,0:22:17.07,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\t(690,1840,\alpha&HFF&)\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}你輕輕推開了沉沒在海中的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.89,0:22:17.07,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,你輕輕推開了沉沒在海中的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.07,0:22:19.19,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,那扇門
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.19,0:22:20.90,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1100,0)\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}Wanna me Wanna me Wanna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.19,0:22:20.90,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,Wanna me Wanna me Wanna me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:24.99,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}在別人對我有所認知之前
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.90,0:22:24.99,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,在別人對我有所認知之前
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.99,0:22:27.29,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}我實際上
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.99,0:22:27.29,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,我實際上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.29,0:22:29.12,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1840)\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}Gonna me Gonna me Gonna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.29,0:22:29.12,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,Gonna me Gonna me Gonna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.12,0:22:32.08,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,對自己有清楚的認知
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.08,0:22:35.46,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,獨自一人也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:37.25,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1810,0)\3c&HACA69C&\bord6\blur4}隨著季節更替
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.46,0:22:37.25,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,隨著季節更替
